s."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.instruction.sign":[{"type":0,"value":"Sign the top of the form."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.instruction.vendors":[{"type":0,"value":"Select two vendors you\'ve traded with for at least 12 months, whose trade volume with you exceeds the credit limit you\'re requesting. Please note that they can\'t be related entities."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.intro":[{"type":0,"value":"Thank you for your interest in setting up Net-30 payment terms with us. After reviewing your D&B credit profile, we\'re unable to approve the request at this time."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.option1-accounting-team":[{"type":0,"value":"Your accounting team should be able to provide these. They\'ll give us a clearer view of your account and support our reassessment."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.option1-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Option 1: Provide your audited financial statements"}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.option1-intro":[{"type":0,"value":"If you haven\'t already shared these, please send your most recent:"}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.option2-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Option 2: Provide trade references"}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.option2-intro":[{"type":0,"value":"If you\'d prefer this option, please complete the attached trade reference form. Here\'s what we\'ll need:"}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.reconsider":[{"type":0,"value":"If you\'d like us to reconsider, we\'d be glad to take another look with some additional information from your end."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.thank-you":[{"type":0,"value":"Thank you again for being an Atlassian customer. We appreciate your business and look forward to hearing from you soon."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.two-options":[{"type":0,"value":"You have two options:"}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.whats-next-body":[{"type":0,"value":"Please let us know which option you\'d like to pursue, or feel free to reach out with any questions. We\'re here to support you and want to make this process as straightforward as possible."}],"commerce.commerce-credit-trade-reference-request-ccp.message-template.whats-next-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"What happens next?"}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.email.body.removed-contact":[{"type":1,"value":"name"},{"type":0,"value":" ("},{"type":1,"value":"email"},{"type":0,"value":")"}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.caption":[{"type":0,"value":"Customer contact removed"}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.contact-removed":[{"type":0,"value":"Contact removed: "}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.impacted-subscriptions":[{"type":0,"value":"Impacted subscriptions:"}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.intro":[{"type":0,"value":"We\'ve removed a key customer contact from a billing profile."}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.questions":[{"type":0,"value":"If you have any questions, please reach out to your Atlassian billing partner."}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.removed-by":[{"type":0,"value":"Removed by: "}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.view-changes":[{"type":0,"value":"You can view the changes at "},{"type":1,"value":"url"},{"type":0,"value":" page."}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.body.view-changes-link":[{"type":0,"value":"partner managed subscriptions"}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.remaining-subs":[{"type":0,"value":"+ "},{"type":1,"value":"remainingCount"},{"type":0,"value":" subscriptions."}],"commerce.commerce-customer-contact-remove-digest.message-template.email.subject":[{"type":0,"value":"Customer contact removed"}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body-p1":[{"type":0,"value":"U.S. law prohibits Atlassian, an Australian corporation with offices in the United States, from providing you with access to our products and services. After analyzing the applicable lists of restricted parties maintained by the U.S. Government, we were unable to confirm that your name was not affiliated with a restricted party."}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body-p2":[{"type":0,"value":"If this is a case of misidentification, please reply with two different copies of official documentation to verify your identity."}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body-p3":[{"type":0,"value":"Official documentation includes, but is not limited to, a government-issued driver\'s license or identification card, passport, utility bill, mortgage or bank statement, etc. Please make sure your full name and address are clearly visible."}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body-p4":[{"type":0,"value":"You may check out these resources for more information: U.S. export controls ("},{"type":1,"value":"exportControl"},{"type":0,"value":") | Consolidated Screening List ("},{"type":1,"value":"csl"},{"type":0,"value":")"}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body-p5":[{"type":0,"value":"Please reply directly via email with any further questions and the identification requested."}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body-p6":[{"type":0,"value":"We look forward to your reply."}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body.csl":[{"type":0,"value":"https://www.trade.gov/consolidated-screening-list"}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.body.exportControl":[{"type":0,"value":"https://www.trade.gov/us-export-controls"}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.caption":[{"type":0,"value":"Deactivated Atlassian Account"}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.salutation":[{"type":0,"value":"Dear Atlassian user,"}],"commerce.commerce-customers-deactivation-eve.email.subject":[{"type":0,"value":"Deactivated Atlassian Account"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.billed-based-on-the-users":[{"type":0,"value":"Until now, billing for this app has been linked to your total user count for Jira. The change will mean that you\'ll be billed based on the number of agents who use the Jira Service Management subscription instead."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.billing-flexibility-info-message":[{"type":0,"value":"Billing flexibility is now available for your "},{"type":1,"value":"productName"},{"type":0,"value":" for Jira Service Management app."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.body.this-change-will-introduce-pricing-updates":[{"type":0,"value":"The change will introduce pricing updates that are set out by our Marketplace partners. These updates will come into effect with the new way of billing, even if your user count isn\'t updated."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.body.we-will-make-the-change":[{"type":0,"value":"We\'ll automatically make the change on "},{"type":1,"value":"nextBillingDate"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.caption":[{"type":0,"value":"Have more billing flexibility and only pay for what you need"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.if-you-dont-do-anything":[{"type":0,"value":"If you don\'t do anything"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.maximize-your-billing-efficiency":[{"type":0,"value":"Maximize your billing efficiency"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.need-more-info":[{"type":0,"value":"Need more info? See our guide on "},{"type":1,"value":"howMarketplaceAreBilled"},{"type":0,"value":"."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.billed-based-on-the-users":[{"type":0,"value":"Until now, billing for this app has been linked to your customer\'s total user count for Jira. The change will mean that your customer will be billed based on the number of agents who use the Jira Service Management subscription instead."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.billing-flexibility-info-message":[{"type":0,"value":"Billing flexibility is now available for your customer\'s "},{"type":1,"value":"productName"},{"type":0,"value":" for Jira Service Management app."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.body.this-change-will-introduce-pricing-updates":[{"type":0,"value":"The change will introduce pricing updates that are set out by our Marketplace partners. These updates will come into effect with the new way of billing, even if your user count isn\'t updated."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.body.we-will-make-the-change":[{"type":0,"value":"We\'ll automatically make the change on "},{"type":1,"value":"nextBillingDate"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.caption":[{"type":0,"value":"Give your customer more billing flexibility"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.customer-label":[{"type":0,"value":"Customer: "},{"type":1,"value":"customerName"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.pay-for-what-you-need":[{"type":0,"value":"To only pay for what you need, your customer can update the number of JSM agents by heading to Atlassian Administration."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.pay-only-for-users-who-need-access":[{"type":0,"value":"This means they have the option to only pay for the users that really need access."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.partner.review-your-bill":[{"type":0,"value":"Make the switch now so your customer can start making the most of billing flexibility for this app. Keep in mind that the bill may be impacted, and can be changed by the organization admin by managing JSM access as needed. We\'d recommend reviewing the bill as you make the change."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.pay-for-what-you-need":[{"type":0,"value":"To only pay for what you need, your organization admin can update the number of JSM agents by heading to Atlassian Administration."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.pay-only-for-users-who-need-access":[{"type":0,"value":"This means you have the option to only pay for the users that really need access."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.review-your-bill":[{"type":0,"value":"Make the switch now to start making the most of billing flexibility for this app. Keep in mind that your bill may be impacted, and can be changed by the organization admin by managing JSM access as needed. We\'d recommend reviewing your bill as you make the change."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.subject.no-translate":[{"type":0,"value":"Update billing for your Marketplace app"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.what-do-i-need-to-do":[{"type":0,"value":"What do I need to do?"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-ccp.message-template.email.what-does-this-mean":[{"type":0,"value":"What does this mean?"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.body.direct.p1":[{"type":0,"value":"As requested, we\'ve updated the way you\'re billed for "},{"type":1,"value":"productName"},{"type":0,"value":" for Jira Service Management. You can now enjoy more control over who has access to and is charged for the app, and your bill will be based on the number of Jira Service Management agents, instead of the user count for Jira."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.body.direct.p2":[{"type":0,"value":"It\'s a good idea to review who you\'d like to have access to the app. Keep in mind that your bill may be impacted, and organization admins can change it by managing who has access to the app as needed."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.body.partner.p1":[{"type":0,"value":"As requested, we\'ve updated the way your customer is billed for "},{"type":1,"value":"productName"},{"type":0,"value":" for Jira Service Management. They can now enjoy more control over who has access to and is charged for the app, and the bill will be linked to the number of JSM agents instead of the user count for Jira."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.body.partner.p2":[{"type":0,"value":"It\'s a good idea to remind your customer to review who they\'d like to have access to the app, and their bill may be impacted. Organization admins can adjust the bill by managing who has access to the app as needed."}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.button.view-subscription":[{"type":0,"value":"View subscription"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.help":[{"type":0,"value":"Have a question? We\'re here to help. "},{"type":1,"value":"getInTouch"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offering-order-confirmation-ccp.message-template.email.link.get-in-touch":[{"type":0,"value":"Get in touch"}],"commerce.commerce-decoupled-offe