ion with"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-no-price-increase.message-template.email.step1Title.jiraConf":[{"type":0,"value":"faster project completion with"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-no-price-increase.message-template.email.step2Description.jiraConf":[{"type":0,"value":"Use AI to search through all docs and channels to find the right info."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-no-price-increase.message-template.email.step2Title.jiraConf":[{"type":0,"value":"less time searching for work with"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Copy1.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Start with a simple prompt like \\"plan a Q3 launch\\" and let Rovo draft a structured project plan."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Copy1.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Start with a simple prompt like \\"plan a Q3 launch\\" and let Rovo draft a structured project plan."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Copy1.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Start with a simple prompt like \\"plan a Q3 launch\\" and let Rovo draft a structured project plan. Turn key milestones into Jira work items, with fields, assignees, and due dates pre‑filled and linked back to a plan in Confluence."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Copy2.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Turn key milestones into Jira issues, with fields, assignees, and due dates pre‑filled and linked back to your plan in Confluence."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Copy2.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Turn key milestones into Jira work items, with fields, assignees, and due dates pre‑filled and linked back to a plan in Confluence."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Copy2.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Add a Loom recording to your pages & tickets to keep your teams up to date!"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Subhead.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"From project idea → structured plan"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Subhead.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"From project idea → structured plan"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article1Subhead.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"From project idea → structured plan"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Copy1.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Write specs in Confluence, create linked Jira work items with tasks, owners, and due dates."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Copy1.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Confluence captures your project plans, notes, and decision logs as organized knowledge that stays connected to your Jira work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Copy1.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Confluence captures your project plans, notes, and decision logs as organized knowledge that stays connected to your Jira work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Copy2.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"No more \\"Who picked this?\\" or \\"Who\'s on point?\\" weeks later."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Copy2.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"See the \\"why\\" and \\"how\\" behind any work item – no digging required."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Copy2.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"See the \\"why\\" and \\"how\\" behind any work item – no digging required."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Subhead.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Product requirements → Development tickets"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Subhead.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Docs and decisions that stay in sync with issues"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article2Subhead.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Docs and decisions that stay in sync with issues"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Copy1.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Drop Loom videos straight into Confluence pages and Jira work items to add instant visual context and reduce confusion."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Copy1.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Drop Loom videos straight into Jira work items and Confluence pages to add instant visual context and reduce confusion."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Copy1.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Add Instant Visual Context: Embed Loom videos directly into your Jira issues and Confluence pages to clearly explain complex ideas and reduce confusion. Automate Next Steps: Let AI automatically summarize your recordings, extract key feedback, and link action items directly to your work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Copy2.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Then let Loom AI auto‑capture feedback, summarize meetings, and turn recordings into action items so work keeps moving forward without more meetings."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Copy2.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Then let Loom AI auto‑capture feedback, summarize meetings, and turn recordings into action items so work keeps moving forward without more meetings."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Copy2.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Eliminate Additional Meetings: Keep your team perfectly aligned and work moving forward asynchronously"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Subhead.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Async updates without more meetings"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Subhead.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Async updates without more meetings"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.article3Subhead.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Async updates without more meetings"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.articleHeader.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Here\'s how teams use Teamwork Collection:"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.articleHeader.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Here\'s how teams use Teamwork Collection:"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.articleHeader.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Here\'s how teams use Teamwork Collection:"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.confluenceArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"Your best work already starts in Confluence. "},{"children":[{"type":0,"value":"Teamwork Collection"}],"type":8,"value":"link"},{"type":0,"value":" helps you get to results faster."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.confluenceData":[{"type":0,"value":"Teams that use Teamwork Collection see one consistent pattern: less chaos and faster progress on the work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.confluencePlatform":[{"type":0,"value":"Confluence is where your team thinks: project plans, decision logs, documentation, meeting notes, etc.\\n\\nBut after you agree on what to do, work frequently scatters into different tools and channels. Tasks get lost, updates go stale, and stakeholders aren\'t sure where to look for the latest.\\n\\n"},{"children":[{"type":0,"value":"Teamwork Collection"}],"type":8,"value":"link"},{"type":0,"value":" closes that gap. \\n\\nTeamwork Collection combines "},{"children":[{"type":0,"value":"Jira + Confluence + Loom + Rovo AI"}],"type":8,"value":"bold"},{"type":0,"value":" into one connected workspace."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"With Teamwork Collection, Jira remains the structured backbone of your work, but your teams also get shared context, knowledge, and AI to help them go further, faster."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraConfArticle":[{"type":0,"value":"With Teamwork Collection, Jira & Confluence remain the structured backbones of your work, but your teams also get shared context, knowledge, and AI to help them go further, faster."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraConfData":[{"type":0,"value":"You already have a head start with Jira and Confluence. Upgrading to Teamwork Collection adds Loom and Rovo AI, bringing one consistent pattern to your workflows: less chaos and faster progress on the work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraConfDataHasRovo":[{"type":0,"value":"You already have a head start with Jira and Confluence. Upgrading to Teamwork Collection adds Loom, bringing one consistent pattern to your workflows: less chaos and faster progress on the work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraConfPlatform":[{"type":0,"value":"Confluence and Jira already help you plan and track your work. Adding Loom and Rovo to your tools brings greater clarity, faster progress, and improved teamwork."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraConfPlatformHasRovo":[{"type":0,"value":"Confluence and Jira already help you plan and track your work. Adding Loom to your tools brings greater clarity, faster progress, and improved teamwork."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraData":[{"type":0,"value":"Teams that use Teamwork Collection see one consistent pattern: less chaos and faster progress on the work."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bodyCopy.jiraPlatform":[{"type":0,"value":"Teamwork Collection brings Jira, Confluence, Loom, and Rovo AI together, augmenting your work already in Jira with clearer plans, shared context, and fewer status meetings."}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bullet1.confluenceData":[{"children":[{"type":0,"value":"3x faster delivery"}],"type":8,"value":"bold"},{"type":0,"value":": Less app switching and manual copy‑pasting across tools"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bullet1.confluencePlatform":[{"type":0,"value":"Plan and document in Confluence"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bullet1.jiraConfData":[{"children":[{"type":0,"value":"3x faster delivery"}],"type":8,"value":"bold"},{"type":0,"value":": Less app switching and manual copy-pasting across tools"}],"growth-starburst.twc-marketing-email-v2.bullet1.jiraConfPlatform"