be the slowest part of your rollout anymore."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.01-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Privacy features your security team will love"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.02-body":[{"type":0,"value":"Enable, disable, or lock individual capabilities — site by site, feature by feature. Manage in-page reading features with one consistent policy surface. No more all-or-nothing deployments."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.02-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Granular deployment you can tailor site by site"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.03-body":[{"type":0,"value":"Give Rovo the ability to read and analyze web page content to provide smarter, more relevant answers. It only accesses what you can see, and never stores page data."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.03-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Grounded answers with page context"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.04-body":[{"type":0,"value":"Take control of the new tab experience. Activate the Rovo New Tab Page to leverage company-wide announcements and custom branding, or set a custom URL like your own intranet. Give your users the flexibility they want with the alignment your organization needs. Full choice, full control."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.04-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"A New Tab Page built for your team"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.actions-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Get started"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.greeting-introduction":[{"type":0,"value":"You’ve been telling us what the Rovo browser extension needs before it’s ready for broad rollout. We’ve shipped a wave of upgrades to make it safer, more controllable, and easier to deploy on your terms."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.header-image.atlassian-icon-alt.no-translate":[{"type":0,"value":"Atlassian Rovo"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.improvements-heading":[{"type":0,"value":"Here\'s what you get"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.install-button":[{"type":0,"value":"Download the extension"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.instructions-link":[{"type":0,"value":"Or learn how to roll out the Rovo extension across your org"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.personal-greeting":[{"type":0,"value":"Hi "},{"type":1,"value":"name"},{"type":0,"value":"!"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.sign-off":[{"type":0,"value":"Have questions about the Rovo browser extension or just keen to learn more? Reach out to us at "},{"type":1,"value":"rovoExtEmail"},{"type":0,"value":" – we’re happy to help!"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.subject":[{"type":0,"value":"Rovo browser extension: new admin upgrades, ready to roll out"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.summary-1":[{"type":0,"value":"Less risk, more choice. A direct line to every user. A new tab that finally looks like it belongs to your company."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-admin-improvements-email.message-template.email.summary-2":[{"type":0,"value":"If you’ve been waiting for the right moment to roll out the Rovo browser extension across your org, this is it."}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extension-download-end-users-i18n.email.body.greeting":[{"type":0,"value":"Hi "},{"type":1,"value":"name"},{"type":0,"value":"!"}],"rovo-expansion.rovo-extensi